{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Shake yourself from the dust.</b> By way of parable; therefore he said arise, for she was lying in the dust." "<b>Untie the fetters of your neck.</b> The meaning: that you will no longer be under the rule of a nation."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 52, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:06.285550102Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}